      "id": 16797,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-29T16:24:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>http://theletterspage.libsyn.com/interlude-6-maintenance-mode</p><p>Glad we got the Crisis with Infinite K.N.Y.F.E.s issue worked out. &nbsp;Honestly I'm surprised at how few nitpicks they decided to do, but that was a big one.</p><p>Also good to know that the animal universe is a thing (which I will proceed to call the Sealiverse).</p><p>Which raises the question: FILTER clearly has a good grasp on many of the different universes out there. &nbsp;Did they know about the Sealiverse? &nbsp;Did they attempt to recruit animal Paige Huntly? &nbsp;Is there a side-story out there about the adventures of the Furious Energy Leasher Yielding Neutralization? &nbsp;Presumably Rogue Agent F.E.L.Y.N. escapes the destruction of FILTER, and most likely joins KNYFE on her space-faring adventures.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:49:39.099Z",
