      "created_at": "2017-06-29T17:36:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'll admit to being one of the people that are shocked that they are doing Ra The Ennead and Argent now. Figured we would get Guise, Visionary, the Scholar, the sentinels/void guard &nbsp;&amp; Parse and their various villains and some environment stuff waaaay before the Prime Wardens + Sky-scraper where they would have to talk about Prime War/Rise of The Ennead stuff = P &nbsp;</p>",
