      "created_at": "2017-06-29T18:09:51.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm more surprised they're just doing an interlude on all the mini-nemeses. Not counting the ones that get upgrades later on (Choke, Empyreon), I count about 30 in the various team villain decks. &nbsp;That's about one a minute for a half-hour interlude, not nearly enough for the detail that some of them (like Glamour) really need.</p>",
